      "created_at": "2015-02-08T00:42:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't think so. I think Christopher said that something can't be destroyed twice (let me see if I can find the link). However, it could have changed after Handelabra talked with Christopher about the app.</p><p>EDIT: Not sure if I read it wrong first, or you changed it, but the app is correct. While something is being destroyed, it is still a target, still ahs hp, and can still be targeted. Handelabra discussed with Christopher at length about how to handle \"when destroyed\" effects.</p>",
